dentity key verification & zero-trust room tokens","Interactive Shared Files Vault with 1-command downloads (/files, /get)","Ephemeral channels with /destroy and self-destruct countdown timers","Multi-platform support for Linux, macOS, Windows, and Termux"],"techStack":["CLI / Terminal","P2P Architecture","Ed25519 Cryptography","Git / GitHub"],"githubUrl":"https://github.com/BrianC0des/termchat","isPrivate":false}}]]}]]}]
